\image{conf-siddiqi-impulsivity-mapping.jpg}

\p{\strong{Caption.} A \strong{lesion/connectivity network-mapping} pipeline (Fox/Siddiqi method) to derive a brain-circuit target for \strong{impulsivity} that generalizes across cohorts — ADHD (n=23) and MDD (n=50). Resting-state functional connectivity from each stimulation site is linked to post-TMS impulsivity change, and convergent circuits are validated against inhibition tasks. The circuit-target inference layer that would tell any montage device in [[bcf-devices]] \em{where} to aim.}
